# Scheme: R7RS small (Revised7 Report on the Algorithmic Language Scheme), 2 Lexical conventions, 4 Expressions; requirements/languages/scheme.md
name     scheme scm ss

keyword  define lambda let let* letrec letrec* let-values if cond case and or when unless do begin quote
keyword  quasiquote unquote set! define-syntax let-syntax syntax-rules else define-record-type
keyword  define-values parameterize guard delay import export library
builtin  car cdr cons list map for-each apply append length reverse display newline null? pair? list?
builtin  equal? eq? eqv? not vector string-append number->string error

ident-extra    !?*<>=/+-
ident-part     !?*<>=/+-.:
line-comment   ;
block-comment  #| |#  : nested
string   " "  : escapes multiline
escape        : x=2
call-after-paren
hook     lisp
hook     apostrophe
